The method

The analysis implements the technique described in:

    Liu, J. M. (1982). Simple technique for measurements of pulsed
    Gaussian-beam spot sizes. Optics Letters, 7(5), 196.
    https://doi.org/10.1364/OL.7.000196

The paper describes a method and is not distributed here. See CITATION.cff.
